silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_05_validation_and_shapes_sections_04_validation_report_as_olog_object_concrete_anchor_5#mittensmeasurementshapegate silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensMeasurementShapeGate is In section 'Validation Report as First-Class Olog Object' the bare symbol ResubmittedCandidate anchors to MittensMeasurementShapeGate: The SHACL shape constraint node that any measurement-leg input must satisfy: required fields are cited_source, value, date, observer; a failed input is rejected before publication." .
